---
title: "Automotive Knowledge Graph - Architecture"
---
graph TB
    subgraph Presentation["🎨 Presentation Layer"]
        YASGUI["YASGUI<br/>Web Interface<br/>:8080"]
        Jupyter["Jupyter Lab<br/>Notebooks<br/>:8888"]
        Python["Python API<br/>RDFLib"]
    end
    
    subgraph Query["🔍 Query Layer"]
        SPARQL["SPARQL Endpoint<br/>HTTP REST API<br/>:3030/automotive"]
    end
    
    subgraph Reasoning["🧠 Reasoning Layer"]
        Reasoner["OWL Reasoner<br/>Jena OWLFBRuleReasoner"]
        InferenceRules["Inference Rules:<br/>• Subclass hierarchy<br/>• Inverse properties<br/>• Transitivity<br/>• Symmetry"]
    end
    
    subgraph Storage["💾 Storage Layer"]
        TDB["Apache Jena TDB2<br/>Native RDF Store<br/>800+ triples"]
        OntoGraph["Ontology Graph<br/>automotive-ontology.ttl"]
        DataGraph["Data Graph<br/>automotive-instances.ttl"]
    end
    
    subgraph Validation["✅ Validation Layer"]
        SHACL["SHACL Engine<br/>pyshacl"]
        Shapes["13 Constraint Shapes:<br/>• Cardinality rules<br/>• Range validations<br/>• Business logic"]
    end
    
    YASGUI -->|HTTP POST| SPARQL
    Jupyter -->|SPARQLWrapper| SPARQL
    Python -->|RDFLib| TDB
    
    SPARQL -->|Query + Inference| Reasoner
    Reasoner -->|Pattern Match| TDB
    Reasoner -.-|Uses| InferenceRules
    
    TDB -->|Contains| OntoGraph
    TDB -->|Contains| DataGraph
    
    SHACL -->|Validates| TDB
    SHACL -.-|Uses| Shapes
    
    style Presentation fill:#e1f5ff
    style Query fill:#fff3e0
    style Reasoning fill:#f3e5f5
    style Storage fill:#e8f5e9
    style Validation fill:#fff9c4
